cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this repository and its accompanying manuscript."
title: "Recurrence Dynamics Framework: Predictive State Quotients, Period Constraints, and Phase Navigation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sundy
    given-names: Scott A.
date-released: 2026-08-09
abstract: >-
  A reproducible framework for complete-state recurrence, observational
  recurrence, predictive equivalence, hidden-state ambiguity, recurrence-period
  constraints, invariant interaction fibers, and phase navigation in
  deterministic dynamics. The framework includes exact 3x3 and 4x4 HPP period
  benchmarks, analytic transport and diagonal-histogram clocks, exact line
  momenta, and an exhaustive 2,209-state interaction-fiber decomposition around
  the 5x5 seed-75202 period-9,705 orbit.
keywords:
  - recurrence dynamics
  - recurrence period
  - phase navigation
  - predictive equivalence
  - observability
  - invariant fibers
  - reversible dynamics
  - HPP lattice gas
  - finite-state systems
  - computational physics
